<title>USA: Danbury, Conn., won by State Street Bank &amp; Trust.</title>
<headline>Danbury, Conn., won by State Street Bank &amp; Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Street Bank &amp; Trust Company of Boston said it won $10.100 million of Danbury, Conn., general obligation bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.78 percent.</p>
